sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ap as Approver (Manager / SecurityReviewer / ItAdmin)
  participant API as AccessRequestsController.Decide
  participant WF as WorkflowService
  participant DB as Azure SQL
  Ap->>API: POST /api/requests/{id}/decision {approved, notes}
  API->>API: Policy CanApprove (Manager, SecurityReviewer, ItAdmin)
  API->>DB: Load request + Approvals
  alt Not found
    API-->>Ap: 404 Not Found
  else Approver is the requester
    API-->>Ap: 403 Forbidden (no self-approval)
  else Request not awaiting a decision
    API-->>Ap: 400 Bad Request
  else Caller lacks role for current stage
    API-->>Ap: 403 Forbidden (Manager / Security / IT stage check)
  else Allowed
    API->>WF: Advance(req, stage, approved)
    WF-->>API: next status (Rejected / SecurityApproval / ItProcessing / Provisioned)
    API->>DB: INSERT ApprovalStep, UPDATE Status and UpdatedAt
    API->>DB: INSERT AuditEntry (Decision, stage, approved)
    API-->>Ap: 200 OK RequestResponse
  end
